{"1458300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Gap", "steam_appid": 1458300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2645140], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gap tells a story of one man’s struggle to find a cure for his family’s illness through the exploration of parallel realities which include memories dear to his heart, forcing him to dive deeper into his psyche. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/extras/f2da83611cb0729ab79c8d16e83e98e6.poster.avif?t=1768413923\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/extras/f2da83611cb0729ab79c8d16e83e98e6.webm?t=1768413923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/extras/f2da83611cb0729ab79c8d16e83e98e6.mp4?t=1768413923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joshua Hayes is a neuroscientist, whose family is affected by a rare neurological disorder that slowly eats away at one’s capability and mental well-being. The struggle and fight of the family is witnessed through the lens of his highest and lowest moments. While exploring the raw, minimalist spaces, he comes across items that act as gateways to his past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/extras/63cb912216d5450a2bfed6f1d76ad417.poster.avif?t=1768413923\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/extras/63cb912216d5450a2bfed6f1d76ad417.webm?t=1768413923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/extras/63cb912216d5450a2bfed6f1d76ad417.mp4?t=1768413923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moreover, while taking part in an experimental neuroscientific program, led by a biotech giant - Neuraxis, Joshua unknowingly finds himself entangled in a corporate intrigue.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/extras/ce8130f9e2d59f2f656fd3e888b457b1.poster.avif?t=1768413923\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/extras/ce8130f9e2d59f2f656fd3e888b457b1.webm?t=1768413923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/extras/ce8130f9e2d59f2f656fd3e888b457b1.mp4?t=1768413923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In hopes of unraveling the web of memories, he’ll need to face a distressing question - can he really trust himself?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gap tells a story of one man’s struggle to find a cure for his family’s illness through the exploration of parallel realities which include memories dear to his heart, forcing him to dive deeper into his psyche. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/extras/f2da83611cb0729ab79c8d16e83e98e6.poster.avif?t=1768413923\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/extras/f2da83611cb0729ab79c8d16e83e98e6.webm?t=1768413923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/extras/f2da83611cb0729ab79c8d16e83e98e6.mp4?t=1768413923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joshua Hayes is a neuroscientist, whose family is affected by a rare neurological disorder that slowly eats away at one’s capability and mental well-being. The struggle and fight of the family is witnessed through the lens of his highest and lowest moments. While exploring the raw, minimalist spaces, he comes across items that act as gateways to his past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/extras/63cb912216d5450a2bfed6f1d76ad417.poster.avif?t=1768413923\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/extras/63cb912216d5450a2bfed6f1d76ad417.webm?t=1768413923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/extras/63cb912216d5450a2bfed6f1d76ad417.mp4?t=1768413923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moreover, while taking part in an experimental neuroscientific program, led by a biotech giant - Neuraxis, Joshua unknowingly finds himself entangled in a corporate intrigue.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/extras/ce8130f9e2d59f2f656fd3e888b457b1.poster.avif?t=1768413923\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/extras/ce8130f9e2d59f2f656fd3e888b457b1.webm?t=1768413923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/extras/ce8130f9e2d59f2f656fd3e888b457b1.mp4?t=1768413923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In hopes of unraveling the web of memories, he’ll need to face a distressing question - can he really trust himself?</p>", "short_description": "Driven by a rare neurological affliction plaguing his family, Joshua has to recover his memories by exploring parallel realities through déjà vu. Facing the innermost depths of his past – moments both joyous and painful – seems to be the only way to get his life and family back together.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“[..] let me reassure you that The Gap is not only a novel and fascinating approach to the topic, but it’s also not maudlin or mawkish at any point.”<br>John Walker - Buried Treasure<br><br>“The Gap is a masterpiece that deserves all the accolades it has received and more. If you’re looking for a game that will not only entertain but also leave a lasting impact, The Gap is an absolute must-play.”<br>10/10 – Rectify Gaming<br><br>“This is a clever and engaging thriller, brought to life with believable characters and a very grounded approach to science fiction that we can really get behind.”<br>95/100 – Hooked Gamers<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/6feafb391af1d2fddf07a52e83b92452f0134d23/header.jpg?t=1768413923", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1458300/d7fc1f5b05acc380917bc11c8d4d55d238df20ff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768413923", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it